     "windows": [
      [
       470.14,
       499.22
      ]
     ],
     "local": false,
     "bars": [
      111,
      115
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "S14-B1-p3",
     "bead": "S14-B1",
     "text": "心里仍然温热，身体却慢慢恢复了平静。",
     "windows": [
      [
       470.14,
       499.22
      ]
     ],
     "local": false,
     "bars": [
      111,
      115
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "S14-B1-p4",
     "bead": "S14-B1",
     "text": "也像从一场美梦里醒来，还记得梦里的光。",
     "windows": [
      [
       470.14,
       499.22
      ]
     ],
     "local": false,
     "bars": [
      111,
